@startuml
title MedNexus AI - Medical Term Search

actor User
participant "React Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Node.js / Express" as Backend
participant "NCBI MeSH API" as MeSH

User -> Frontend : Enter medical term
Frontend -> Backend : Send search request
Backend -> MeSH : Search medical term
MeSH --> Backend : Return term identifiers
Backend -> MeSH : Retrieve term details
MeSH --> Backend : Return term details
Backend --> Frontend : Return search results
Frontend --> User : Display term information

@enduml
